  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "priest-ending",
      "node": "PriestEnding",
      "speaker": "乔纳",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_001",
          "sourceId": "priest-ending__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_001",
          "sourceRow": 2,
          "sourceCell": "D2",
          "text": "咚咚咚。",
          "portraitId": "PE01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "ED_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_002"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_002",
          "sourceId": "priest-ending__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_002",
          "sourceRow": 3,
          "sourceCell": "D3",
          "text": "你果然也听到了。",
          "portraitId": "PE01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "ED_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_003"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_003",
          "sourceId": "priest-ending__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_003",
          "sourceRow": 4,
          "sourceCell": "D4",
          "text": "门叩响的声音。",
          "portraitId": "PE01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "ED_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_004"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_004",
          "sourceId": "priest-ending__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_004",
          "sourceRow": 5,
          "sourceCell": "D5",
          "text": "那你为什么要把我拒之门外……",
          "portraitId": "PE01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "ED_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_005"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_005",
          "sourceId": "priest-ending__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_005",
          "sourceRow": 6,
          "sourceCell": "D6",
          "text": "我只想寻求净化，你为什么又要把我放回这污浊的世间？",
          "portraitId": "PE01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "ED_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_006"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_006",
          "sourceId": "priest-ending__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_006",
          "sourceRow": 7,
          "sourceCell": "D7",
          "text": "一定是上帝……您还期盼我给更多人带来净化。",
          "portraitId": "PE01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "ED_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_007"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_007",
          "sourceId": "priest-ending__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_007",
          "sourceRow": 8,
          "sourceCell": "D8",
          "text": "来吧孩子，我会帮你洗涤罪恶。",
          "portraitId": "PE02",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "ED_02",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_008"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_008",
          "sourceId": "priest-ending__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_008",
          "sourceRow": 9,
          "sourceCell": "D9",
          "text": "拥抱净化吧。",
          "portraitId": "",
          "blackScreen": true,
          "originalPortraitId": "ED_03",
          "originalNextId": ""
        }
      ],
      "finalAction": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "self-review",
      "node": "SelfReview",
      "speaker": "玩家自己",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_001",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_001",
          "sourceRow": 2,
          "sourceCell": "D2",
          "text": "我的名字是...我记不清了...",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_002"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_002",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_002",
          "sourceRow": 3,
          "sourceCell": "D3",
          "text": "和你相处这么久了，好像也不重要了。",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_003"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_003",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_003",
          "sourceRow": 4,
          "sourceCell": "D4",
          "text": "我的工作...我是一名公务员，我的工作是按下按键，决定他们的命运。",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_004"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_004",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_004",
          "sourceRow": 5,
          "sourceCell": "D5",
          "text": "记得...当时拿到这份工作，我成为了全家人的荣耀。",
          "portraitId": "SJ02",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_02",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_005"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_005",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_005",
          "sourceRow": 6,
          "sourceCell": "D6",
          "text": "毕竟在这个社会里，能吃饱饭就是奢望了！",
          "portraitId": "SJ02",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_02",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_006"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_006",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_006",
          "sourceRow": 7,
          "sourceCell": "D7",
          "text": "你说是吧，哪还有所谓的...",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_007"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_007",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_007",
          "sourceRow": 8,
          "sourceCell": "D8",
          "text": "自由是什么？自由是什么呢？",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_008"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_008",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_008",
          "sourceRow": 9,
          "sourceCell": "D9",
          "text": "不知道，这好像是一个没有答案的问题。",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_009"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_009",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_009",
          "sourceRow": 10,
          "sourceCell": "D10",
          "text": "那些人，会懂吗？",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_010"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_010",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_010",
          "sourceRow": 11,
          "sourceCell": "D11",
          "text": "他们靠着自己的意志走出去了，外面的世界会欢迎他们吗？",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_011"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_011",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_011",
          "sourceRow": 12,
          "sourceCell": "D12",
          "text": "呵呵...蛀虫已把这个社会蚕食殆尽，哪还会有新鲜的血肉？",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_012"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_012",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_012",
          "sourceRow": 13,
          "sourceCell": "D13",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_013"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_013",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_013",
          "sourceRow": 14,
          "sourceCell": "D14",
          "text": "说不定有呢？你说是吧！",
          "portraitId": "SJ02",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_02",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_014"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_014",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_014",
          "sourceRow": 15,
          "sourceCell": "D15",
          "text": "我想走了。",
          "portraitId": "SJ01",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_01",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_015"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_015",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_015",
          "sourceRow": 16,
          "sourceCell": "D16",
          "text": "妈妈告诉我，我们家曾经在海边的一个小村里。",
          "portraitId": "SJ02",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_02",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_016"
        },
        {
          "id": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_016",
          "sourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_COMMON_016",
          "sourceRow": 17,
          "sourceCell": "D17",
          "text": "那里的天好蓝，水好清澈，我想回去看看了。",
          "portraitId": "SJ02",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "SJ_02",
          "originalNextId": "CUSTOM001_D1_R1_PLAYER_ACTION_001"
        }
      ],
      "finalAction": "purify",
      "finalActionSourceId": "self-review__CUSTOM001_D1_R1_PLAYER_ACTION_001",
      "finalActionSourceRow": 18,
      "finalActionSourceCell": "G18",
      "finalActionText": "净化",
      "finalActionPortraitId": "SJ02"
    },
    {
      "id": "supervisor-ending",
      "node": "SupervisorEnding",
      "speaker": "监督员",
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_001",
          "sourceId": "supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_001",
          "sourceRow": 41,
          "sourceCell": "D41",
          "text": "惊——喜。",
          "portraitId": "JD06",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "JD_06",
          "originalNextId": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002"
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002",
          "sourceId": "supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_002",
          "sourceRow": 42,
          "sourceCell": "D42",
          "text": "做过什么你自己清楚。",
          "portraitId": "JD06",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "JD_06",
          "originalNextId": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_003"
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_003",
          "sourceId": "supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_003",
          "sourceRow": 43,
          "sourceCell": "D43",
          "text": "看来你要跟我走一趟了。",
          "portraitId": "JD06",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "JD_06",
          "originalNextId": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_004"
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_004",
          "sourceId": "supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_004",
          "sourceRow": 44,
          "sourceCell": "D44",
          "text": "进去之后，记得好好表现。",
          "portraitId": "JD06",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "JD_06",
          "originalNextId": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_005"
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_005",
          "sourceId": "supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_005",
          "sourceRow": 45,
          "sourceCell": "D45",
          "text": "也许就不会那么早迎来净化。",
          "portraitId": "JD06",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "JD_06",
          "originalNextId": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_006"
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_006",
          "sourceId": "supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_006",
          "sourceRow": 46,
          "sourceCell": "D46",
          "text": "我们之间也能多玩一会，不是吗？",
          "portraitId": "JD06",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "JD_06",
          "originalNextId": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_007"
        },
        {
          "id": "P02_D4_R1_COMMON_007",
          "sourceId": "supervisor-ending__P02_D4_R1_COMMON_007",
          "sourceRow": 47,
          "sourceCell": "D47",
          "text": "走吧。",
          "portraitId": "JD06",
          "blackScreen": false,
          "originalPortraitId": "JD_06",
          "originalNextId": ""
        }
      ],
      "finalAction": ""
    }
  ],
